        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Working? Sell it or give it away</strong>, priced from local
            listings with the buyer collecting —
            <a href="/new-vs-used-treadmill/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">used values</a>
            hold up better than most people expect. Buying new? Ask about haul-away before you order.
          </p>
